    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present No.2 Rosehaven to the market for sale. This 2 bedroomed, First floor apartment is ideally located off the Carpenterstown Road, just moments from Coolmine Train Station. The development is accessed via an attractive tree lined avenue leading to an open courtyard, with a small surface car park as well as an underground car park, which each owner has access to. \n\nMeasuring 86.9 sqm/935.3 sq.ft. approx., the well-proportioned accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway with hotpress and separate storage press. This gives way to the spacious living/dining room, with access to a private, decked balcony with views over the communal gardens. There is a separate kitchen, just off the living room. No. 2 has 2 generous double bedrooms, both with built in wardrobes and main ensuite. A family bathroom completes. \n\nThis property is excellently positioned just moments from Coolmine Train Station, while also being just a 7 minute walk to a Spar shop, The Carpenter bar, Insomnia café, a takeaway and pharmacy, as well as having an option of schools nearby. There is also easy access to both Rosehaven Shopping Centre and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre. As well as the highly convenient Train Station, there is an excellent bus service just around the corner from the development, allowing easy access to the city centre. \n\nViewing is highly recommended, to appreciate the size and privacy of this property, which is sure to impress."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith lino flooring, containing a convenient storage press and a separate hotpress.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nA spacious, open plan living/dining room with laminate timber flooring and an electric fireplace. Double doors lead to the private, decked balcony, which is not overlooked.\n\nKitchen - \nUpgraded kitchen located just off the living room, with tiled flooring, a good selection of floor and overhead presses, with integrated fridge/freezer, oven and hob. There is plumbing for a washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nA generous double bedroom with good quality, laminate timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - \nWith tiled floor and partly tiled walls, comprising of a wc, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nA second double bedroom with laminate timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - \nA good-sized family bathroom with tiled flooring and partly tiled walls. Comprises of a wc, wash hand basin and a shower over bath.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gated development</li><li>2 parking spaces - communal parking</li><li>Private balcony, not overlooked</li><li>A minutes' walk from Coolmine Train Station</ul>"
      },
